+# Adopted attempt recovery implementation plan
+
+> Execute with superpowers:subagent-driven-development, in this checkout.
+
+Goal: add the specified incident and v2 archival disposition without changing v1 behavior.
+
+Architecture: retain the existing safe file movement and review gates; dispatch schema-specific validation. Reopen archived evidence using row-bound byte overlays, with Git facts taken from the real repository. The user-provided seven-part contract governs exact keys, literals and error codes.
+
+Scope: source_bindings.py (lineage), materialization.py and broad_evidence.py (overlay reads and lineage), attempt_migration.py and an incident helper (incident, capture, dispatch), __init__.py (lazy exports), focused temporary-Git tests. No runtime, workflows, providers or dependencies change.
+
+Tradeoff: separate v2 lifecycle checks preserve v1 semantics but require verifying both routes when shared archival contracts change.
+
+- [x] Derive closed first-parent predecessor projections; test raw messages, malformed trailers, merges and uncovered eligibility.
+- [x] Thread byte overlays and committed fallback through materialization, bound records and reviews; test recursive lineage and duplicate slots.
+- [x] Build and validate incident records from files and Git, including adopted lifecycle and historical baseline validation.
+- [x] Add v2 capture, crash-safe replay, strict dispatch, logical archived view, semantic generation checks and CLI.
+- [x] Test temporary-Git capture/apply/postvalidation and tampering; collect changed test modules; run focused tests then retirement suites with pytest -q -n 16 --dist=worksteal in tmux.
+- [x] Review complete diff, unchanged CLI help surfaces and lazy imports; write required boolean output bundle.
+
+Verification: 875 tests passed with `TMPDIR=/tmp pytest -q -n 16 --dist=worksteal` over the retirement suites and `tests/test_workflow_examples_v0.py`. All 54 new tests collect. Cold lazy imports, unchanged evidence CLI help sets, typed CLI errors, and `git diff --check` also passed. The complete repository suite was not run.
